      "message": "If logical flows are not removed, when adapter tries to repush these logical flows which are having old meter ID\u0027s(upstream meter ID-2, downstream meter ID-3), flow addition will fail due to meter ID mismatch.\n\nMeter ID mismatch will happen because, after OLT reboot eapol flow with default-vlan and meter ID-1 will be installed on the device. We will update this meter ID-1 into the KV store to have control over flow addition.",
